┏ Rooms ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┓┌ Help (q to close) ───────────────────────────────┐
┃  Unread                  ┃│Normal mode                                       │
┃> * #general              ┃│<C-c>              cancel, or leave the mode      │
┃  * &dev-team             ┃│<Esc>              cancel, or leave the mode      │
┃  * @alice                ┃│dd                 delete your message under the c│
┃  Folders                 ┃│e                  edit your message under the cur│
┃  ▾ Work (1)              ┃│<C-w>j             focus the input bar            │
┃      ~design-review      ┃│<C-w>l             focus the messages pane        │
┃      +platform           ┃│<C-w>h             focus the sidebar              │
┃  ▾ People (1)            ┃│za                 fold or unfold the folder      │
┃  Recent                  ┃│<C-d>              half a page down               │
┃    #random               ┃│<C-u>              half a page up                 │
┃    &secrets [e2e]        ┃│G                  jump to the bottom             │
┃    #quiet                ┃│gg                 jump to the top                │
┃                          ┃│j                  move down                      │
┃                          ┃│h                  move left                      │
┃                          ┃│l                  move right                     │
┃                          ┃│k                  move up                        │
